timblserver
------------------------------------------
For server functionality around Timbl

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libticcutils10-0.38-1bl2
  libtimbl-devel-7.0-1bl2
  libtimbl8-7.0-1bl2
  libtimblserver-devel-1.20-1bl1
  libtimblserver5-1.20-1bl1
  libxml2-2.13.9-2
  libxml2-devel-2.13.9-2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  autoconf-archive-2024.10.16-1
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libicu-devel-76.1-2
  libticcutils-devel-0.38-1bl2
  libtimbl-devel-7.0-1bl2
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libxml2-devel-2.13.9-2
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/LanguageMachines/timblserver

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/LanguageMachines/timblserver/archive/refs/tags/v1.20.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack timblserver-1.20-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./timblserver-1.20-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/timblserver-1.20-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/timblserver-1.20-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtimblserver5-1.20-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtimblserver-devel-1.20-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(timblserver)
  /usr/bin/timblclient.exe
  /usr/bin/timblserver.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/timblserver.README
  /usr/share/doc/timblserver/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/timblserver/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/timblserver/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/timblserver/README
  /usr/share/doc/timblserver/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/timblserver/TODO
  /usr/share/man/man1/timblclient.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/timblserver.1.gz

(libtimblserver5)
  /usr/bin/cygtimblserver-5.dll

(libtimblserver-devel)
  /usr/include/timblserver/ClientBase.h
  /usr/include/timblserver/TimblServer.h
  /usr/lib/libtimblserver.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/timblserver.pc

